//! Paths to the compiled `nn_*` WebAssembly test programs.
//!
//! Everything in this crate is generated by `build.rs`: one `&str` constant per
//! test program pointing at its core module, a `*_COMPONENT` constant for the
//! WIT-based programs, and a `foreach_nn!` macro enumerating them all.

include!(concat!(env!("OUT_DIR"), "/gen.rs"));
